summary is: {{ PC: 24yoF with DM and HTN. 
Hx: DM for 4 yrs, HTN for 3 yrs. 
PMHx: HTN, DM, hypothyroidism.
DH: works at a bakery, started working there 2 months ago, has been snacking a lot and eating more desserts than usual, 
Imp: DM out of control, HTN stable.
PE: BP 120/70, HR 60, RR 12, T 36.8, RR 12, PERRL, EOM, NT, 2/2 SE, 2/2 PE, +1/2 SE, +2/4 PE. 
Imp: DM out of control, HTN stable. 
Plan: 
- to cut down on snacking and sweets
- to check BS in the morning and call in in 2 weeks
- to come back in 2 months and recheck BS
- to stay on current HTN med
- to continue metformin 500mg bid. }}<|eot_id|>
